{'symbol': 'ACGL', 'date': '2023-01-30 10:10:00', 'title': 'ARCH INSURANCE NORTH AMERICA ANNOUNCES LAUREN DIETERICH AS CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER', 'text': 'NEW YORK--( BUSINESS WIRE )--ARCH INSURANCE NORTH AMERICA (ARCH) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT LAUREN DIETERICH HAS JOINED THE COMPANY AS CHIEF OPERATING OFFICER. SHE REPORTS TO BRIAN FIRST, PRESIDENT OF ARCH INSURANCE NORTH AMERICA, AND WILL BE A MEMBER OF THE NORTH AMERICAN EXECUTIVE LEADERSHIP TEAM.'}